<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Unseen Chaos</h1>
<p><i>The charter of the clan Unseen Chaos, kept as it was written.</i>
</p><p>As the name suggests we are the bearers of chaos. What we do you will sometimes know. And at other times you will think we have done nothing. We work as a whole yet separately. Everything we do is part of a plan.
</p><p>Our mission is to break people of the old ways, and bring them together to make our world stronger. For growth and peace you first need chaos to bring about the change needed for a stronger whole.
</p><p>We are a tight knit group with very high standards. Very few will be able to meet our expectations and become a member of the elite. If you are lucky enough to be accepted to our order, you will forever be a harbinger of change.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
